{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T07:04:07.336824552Z","verse":31,"ref":"leviticus 25:31","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":25,"translation":"But the houses of the courtyard-villages which have no wall around ⟨them⟩ — upon ⟨the⟩ field of ⟨the⟩ land ⟨they⟩ shall be reckoned. Redemption ⟨shall⟩ belong to it, and in ⟨the⟩ Jubilee ⟨it⟩ shall go out.","tokens":[{"surface":"ובתי","gloss":"But the houses of"},{"surface":"החצרים","gloss":"the villages"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"have no"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"to them"},{"surface":"חמה","gloss":"wall"},{"surface":"סביב","gloss":"around"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"as"},{"surface":"שדה","gloss":"the field of"},{"surface":"הארץ","gloss":"the land"},{"surface":"יחשב","gloss":"shall be reckoned"},{"surface":"גאלה","gloss":"redemption"},{"surface":"תהיה","gloss":"shall be"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"to it"},{"surface":"וביבל","gloss":"and in the Jubilee"},{"surface":"יצא","gloss":"shall go out"}]}